{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/43dae4d59120f27cb30e7ae079eb1321.poster.avif?t=1749454865\" width=654 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/43dae4d59120f27cb30e7ae079eb1321.webm?t=1749454865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/43dae4d59120f27cb30e7ae079eb1321.mp4?t=1749454865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Soul Cards is a single-player roguelike deck-builder game where you must create synergies to score points!</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Soul Cards, everything is about scoring enough points to reach the goal before the deadline and survive. To score points you will play of board of Items and Souls.<br> <br> As you go deeper and deeper in hell, the goal will get higher and higher but don't worry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each round survived you will be rewarded with money. Spend this money in the shop to improve your build ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>It's up to you to choose how to spend your money!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items are the card that will form your deck. Each item has effects and tags. Buying new items will help you specialize your deck and create stronger synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/0ec6ccb434f4c626786798e76c2c401d.poster.avif?t=1749454865\" width=686 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/0ec6ccb434f4c626786798e76c2c401d.webm?t=1749454865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/0ec6ccb434f4c626786798e76c2c401d.mp4?t=1749454865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters are cards that are permanently on the board and will passively apply their effects. More expensive that items, they are also an essential part of your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/cd706a8ab55b359b29b0c852f87a2f01.poster.avif?t=1749454865\" width=686 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/cd706a8ab55b359b29b0c852f87a2f01.webm?t=1749454865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/cd706a8ab55b359b29b0c852f87a2f01.mp4?t=1749454865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, you can use spells to enchant your items and give them additional effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/0cab4dc61b1e2bce231a6d06f88b12f3.poster.avif?t=1749454865\" width=754 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/0cab4dc61b1e2bce231a6d06f88b12f3.webm?t=1749454865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/0cab4dc61b1e2bce231a6d06f88b12f3.mp4?t=1749454865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a huge amount of content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+50 Items to create your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+50 Souls with unique effects to recruit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Different spells to modify your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Materials to modify and boost your items</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408690?t=1749454865","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408690?t=1749454865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/ad98df9f3b06df42fd6eb7531431766b09355c72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749454865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/ad98df9f3b06df42fd6eb7531431766b09355c72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749454865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3774040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/43dae4d59120f27cb30e7ae079eb1321.poster.avif?t=1749454865\" width=654 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/43dae4d59120f27cb30e7ae079eb1321.webm?t=1749454865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/43dae4d59120f27cb30e7ae079eb1321.mp4?t=17494